Let's expand the powers for $\greenD{8^7}=\blueD{8^3}\cdot\purpleD{8^x}$.

$\begin{align}
&=\blueD{\underbrace{8\cdot8\cdot8}_\text{3 times}}\cdot\purpleD{\underbrace{    }_{x\text{ times}}}
\\\\\\
&=\greenD{\underbrace{8\cdot 8\cdot 8\cdot 8\cdot 8\cdot 8\cdot 8}_\text{7 times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
